,"metadata":{}},{"cell_type":"code","source":"kb_embeddings = embedding_model.encode(\n    kb,\n    convert_to_numpy=True,\n    show_progress_bar=True\n)\n\n\nindex = faiss.IndexFlatL2(kb_embeddings.shape[1])\nindex.add(kb_embeddings)\n\nprint(f\"Indexed {index.ntotal} documents.\")","metadata":{"trusted":true,"execution":{"iopub.status.busy":"2026-08-04T15:04:54.984874Z","iopub.execute_input":"2026-08-04T15:04:54.985149Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-08-04T15:04:55.759629Z","shell.execute_reply.started":"2026-08-04T15:04:54.985129Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-08-04T15:04:55.758999Z"}},"outputs":[{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"text/plain":"Batches:   0%|          | 0/50 [00:00<?, ?it/s]","application/vnd.jupyter.widget-view+json":{"version_major":2,"version_minor":0,"model_id":"c55fab15f7a741c1b54ed1d4e345530f"}},"metadata":{}},{"name":"stdout","text":"Indexed 1600 documents.\n","output_type":"stream"}],"execution_count":34},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":"## Dense Retrieval using FAISS\n\nGiven a question, we first generate its embedding using the Sentence Transformer model. The embedding is then used to query the FAISS index, retrieving the top-k most semantically similar documents from the knowledge base. These retrieved documents serve as candidate contexts for the subsequent reranking stage.","metadata":{}},{"cell_type":"code","source":"def retrieve_documents(prompt, k=5):\n    \"\"\"\n    Retrieve the top-k most similar documents from the knowledge base.\n    \"\"\"\n\n    prompt_embedding = embedding_model.encode(\n        [prompt],\n        convert_to_numpy=True\n    )\n\n    distances, indices = index.search(prompt_embedding, k)\n\n    retrieved_docs = [kb[i] for i in indices[0]]\n\n    return retrieved_docs, indices[0], distances[0]","metadata":{"trusted":true,"execution":{"iopub.status.busy":"2026-08-04T15:04:55.760510Z","iopub.execute_input":"2026-08-04T15:04:55.760850Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-08-04T15:04:55.765193Z","shell.execute_reply.started":"2026-08-04T15:04:55.760829Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-08-04T15:04:55.764488Z"}},"outputs":[],"execution_count":35},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":"## Cross-Encoder Reranking\n\nThe initial retrieval step uses a bi-encoder, which retrieves documents efficiently based on embedding similarity. However, embedding similarity alone may not capture the exact semantic relationship between the question and the retrieved document.\n\nTo improve retrieval quality, we use a Cross-Encoder. Unlike a bi-encoder, the Cross-Encoder processes the question and each retrieved document together, allowing the attention mechanism to directly model interactions between them. The retrieved documents are then reranked based on their semantic relevance scores.","metadata":{}},{"cell_type":"code","source":"cross_encoder = CrossEncoder(\n    \"cross-encoder/ms-marco-MiniLM-L-6-v2\"\n)\n\n","metadata":{"trusted":true,"execution":{"iopub.status.busy":"2026-08-04T15:04:55.766005Z","iopub.execute_input":"2026-08-04T15:04:55.766331Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-08-04T15:05:02.258362Z","shell.execute_reply.started":"2026-08-04T15:04:55.766304Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-08-04T15:05:02.257767Z"}},"outputs":[{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"text/plain":"config.json:   0%|          | 0.00/794 [00:00<?, ?B/s]","application/vnd.jupyter.widget-view+json":{"version_major":2,"version_minor":0,"model_id":"806ef4b6518e460485fba51f77ffd015"}},"metadata":{}},{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"text/plain":"model.safetensors:   0%|          | 0.00/90.9M [00:00<?, ?B/s]","application/vnd.jupyter.widget-view+json":{"version_major":2,"version_minor":0,"model_id":"50e008513f9b4f66a47202fcb8340e4e"}},"metadata":{}},{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"text/plain":"Loading weights:   0%|          | 0/105 [00:00<?, ?it/s]","application/vnd.jupyter.widget-view+json":{"version_major":2,"version_minor":0,"model_id":"75e4a4ad648e43ff9a99de5d044bf391"}},"metadata":{}},{"name":"stderr","text":"BertForSequ