"cell_type":"markdown","source":"## Model Evaluation\n\nAfter training, the model was evaluated on the validation dataset using the same metrics that were monitored during training.\n\nThe evaluation provides an unbiased estimate of the model's performance on unseen data and verifies that the model has learned meaningful representations without significant overfitting.\n\nThe following metrics are reported:\n\n- **Validation Loss** – Measures the prediction error.\n- **Validation Accuracy** – Measures the proportion of correctly classified samples.\n- **Validation AUC** – Measures the model's ability to distinguish between positive and negative classes across different decision thresholds.","metadata":{}},{"cell_type":"code","source":"# ==========================================================\n# Evaluate BiLSTM Model\n# ==========================================================\n\nval_loss, val_accuracy, val_auc = model.evaluate(\n    X_val_tf,\n    y_val_tf,\n    verbose=1\n)\n\nprint(f\"\\nValidation Loss     : {val_loss:.4f}\")\nprint(f\"Validation Accuracy : {val_accuracy:.4f}\")\nprint(f\"Validation AUC      : {val_auc:.4f}\")","metadata":{"trusted":true,"execution":{"iopub.status.busy":"2026-08-04T15:08:30.563587Z","iopub.execute_input":"2026-08-04T15:08:30.563935Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-08-04T15:08:31.039852Z","shell.execute_reply.started":"2026-08-04T15:08:30.563911Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-08-04T15:08:31.039040Z"}},"outputs":[{"name":"stdout","text":"\u001b[1m63/63\u001b[0m \u001b[32m━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\u001b[0m\u001b[37m\u001b[0m \u001b[1m0s\u001b[0m 6ms/step - accuracy: 0.9995 - auc: 1.0000 - loss: 0.0025\n\nValidation Loss     : 0.0025\nValidation Accuracy : 0.9995\nValidation AUC      : 1.0000\n","output_type":"stream"}],"execution_count":52},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":"## Validation MAP@3 Evaluation\n\nAlthough the BiLSTM model is trained using Binary Cross-Entropy Loss, the competition evaluates predictions using Mean Average Precisi